OL,0,         GFORUM64   GMo 23 Nov F21:17:04
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,EThe whole internet is a floppy drive   
OL,3,Efor you Commodore with Meatloaf!       
OL,5,CAntwort:  Bskern                       
OL,6,CComments: B343                         
OL,7,F                                       
OL,8,Fich hatte gerne eins                   
OL,10,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,12,GI hope it is ok to post in English.    
OL,13,GI've been a user for a while now but   
OL,14,Ghave not posted anything.              
OL,16,GI apologize in advance if not. I could 
OL,17,Guse a translator but I'm afraid it     
OL,18,Gwould not do as good a job as I'd like.
OL,20,GI was hoping people might be interested
OL,21,Gin my little gadget. It's a 1541 multi 
OL,22,Gdrive emulator and wifi modem. No need 
OL,23,Gfor a PC. It has 16MB of flash memory  
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (1/2) 
FL,0,0,0,0,0,100
