OL,0,         GFORUM64   GMo 23 Nov F21:17:04
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,Gonboard. Can hold a lot of             
OL,4,GD64/D71/D81/T64/TCRT/PRG/P00 file      
OL,5,Gimages. It can also access disk images 
OL,6,Gvia HTTP and load them like they were  
OL,7,Gdirectly mounted from flash. You use   
OL,8,Gsimple LOAD commands to connect via    
OL,9,Ghttp, change directories and mount disk
OL,10,Gimages. It doesn't support any fast    
OL,11,Gloaders yet but I'm working on that.   
OL,12,GAll operations at the moment are read  
OL,13,Gonly as well.                          
OL,15,GI also integrated a WebDAV server so   
OL,16,Gyou can connect to it from your        
OL,17,Gcomputer over Wifi and mount it like   
OL,18,Gany network drive to add/edit/delete   
OL,19,Gfiles in the flash memory.             
OL,21,GIt can be configured to emulate any/all
OL,22,GDevice IDs from 4-30 with a different  
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/2) 
